[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange-5bg5 5...Bg4"]
[Name "Exchange: 5.Bg5 Bg4 6.Bxf6"]

6. Bxf6 exf6 { Takes towards the centre. The doubled pawn does no harm: the bishop on f8 opens, and f6 keeps White's knight out of e5. }
7. Be2 Bd6 { Develops. Black has the two bishops and an easy game. } *
